@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor #FBFCFE
hide circle
left to right direction

class Rover {
  - energy : int
  - samples : int
  - actionCount : int
  + execute(command : int) : String
  - explore() : String
  # exploreYield() : int
}
class HeavyRover {
  + execute(command : int) : String
  + drill() : String
  # exploreYield() : int
}
class Mission {
  - rover : Rover
  + run(script : int[]) : void
}
Rover <|-- HeavyRover
Mission --> "1" Rover : rover
note bottom of HeavyRover
exploreYield覆寫父方法，回3
只回數量，狀態仍由父流程更新
execute覆寫：4交給drill，其他交回super.execute
end note
note bottom of Rover : exploreYield預設回2
note bottom of Mission
部分視角：省略其他成員及MissionStep
Mission不增加HeavyRover型態欄位
end note
@enduml
